            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Couper, Lisa and Sanders, Nate and Heller, Nicole and Gordon, Deborah. 2021. Multi-year drought exacerbates long-term effects of climate on an invasive ant species. Ecology. Dataset available at: https://purl.stanford.edu/dg373xs8682",
